rem Modified Fibonacci Golden Nuggets
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=140
rem Sum the first Count positive n for
rem which the modified Fibonacci
rem generating function is rational

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Count integer = 30

rem The nuggets need 5 n^2 + 14 n + 1 to
rem be a square s^2, so with x = 5 n + 7
rem x^2 - 5 s^2 = 44. Find the small
rem solutions of both signs, then walk
rem each orbit by the unit 9 + 4 sqrt 5.
Y = 0 to 60 array
T = 5 * Y * Y + 44
X = T isqrt
Sq = X * X equal T
X0 = X filter Sq array
Y0 = Y filter Sq array
Xs = concat X0 X0
Ys = concat Y0 (0 - Y0)
All = array shape 0 fill 0
for Step in 1 to 14
  Ok' = Xs mod 5 equal 2 and Xs greater 7
  Hit' = Xs filter Ok array
  All = concat All ((Hit - 7) // 5)
  Next = 9 * Xs + 20 * Ys
  Ys = 4 * Xs + 9 * Ys
  Xs = Next
end
Answer = All unique sort take Count sum
Answer print
